@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="privacy__page">
    <h1>
        @ViewData["Title"]
    </h1>
    <p>
        The Privacy Policy of the Profi Dental Medical Dental Center and its Branch “Profi Dental 
        Kyiv” defines the terms and conditions for using the website https://profidental.com and 
        applies to all users of this web resource.
    </p>
    <h3>
        І. DEFINITIONS
    </h3>
    <p>
        The terms used in this Privacy Policy shall have the following meanings: <br>
        1.1. Personal Data — information or a set of information about an individual who is identified or can 
        be identified. <br>
        1.2. Confidential Information — information about an individual, as well as information access to 
        which is restricted by an individual or a legal entity, except for public authorities. Confidential 
        information may be disclosed at the will (with the consent) of the relevant person in the manner 
        and under the conditions determined by them, as well as in other cases provided for by the 
        legislation of Ukraine. <br>
        1.3. Information Protection — a set of legal, administrative, organizational, technical, and other 
        measures ensuring the preservation, integrity, and proper access to information. <br>
        1.4. Owner of Confidential Information — a person who legally owns confidential information and 
        has restricted access to such information and established a confidentiality regime for it. <br>
        1.5. Access to Confidential Information — familiarization of certain persons with confidential 
        information with the consent of its owner or on another lawful basis for granting access to 
        personal data. <br>
        1.6. User — an individual with legal capacity who has reached the age of 18 and has fully accepted 
        all the terms of this Privacy Policy. <br>
        1.7. Transfer of Confidential Information — the transfer of confidential information recorded on the 
        Profi Dental website by its owner or by the website owner on the basis of an agreement, in the 
        scope and under the conditions provided for by such agreement, including the obligation of the 
        counterparty to comply with confidentiality protection measures. <br>
        1.8. Provision of Confidential Information — the transfer of confidential information recorded on 
        the Profi Dental website by its owner to state authorities, other governmental bodies, or local 
        self-government bodies for the performance of their functions. <br>
        1.9. Disclosure of Confidential Information — any action or inaction as a result of which confidential 
        information becomes known to third parties in any possible form (oral, written, or otherwise, 
        including through technical means) without the consent of the owner of such information or in 
        violation of a civil law agreement.
    </p>
    <h3>
        II. GENERAL PROVISIONS
    </h3>
    <p>
        2.1. This Privacy and Personal Data Protection Policy (hereinafter — the “Privacy Policy”) is valid 
        exclusively within the framework of the Terms of Use of the web resource and does not apply to 
        third-party web resources. <br>
        2.2. The scope of this Privacy Policy applies to any personal data processed by the web resource in 
        accordance with applicable legislation on confidentiality and information. <br>
        2.3. This Privacy Policy represents a set of legal, administrative, organizational, technical, and other 
        measures implemented by Profi Dental and its Branch to ensure the confidentiality and 
        protection of personal data of users of the web resource. <br>
        2.4. The purpose of implementing this Privacy Policy is to prevent public access to and disclosure 
        of information owned by Profi Dental and its Branch. <br>
        2.5. All rights to the content of the web resource belong to Profi Dental or are used with its 
        consent. This web resource is protected by the Law of Ukraine “On Copyright and Related Rights” 
        and other applicable legislative acts of Ukraine. <br>
        2.6. The user’s consent granted to Profi Dental for the collection, processing, storage, and use 
        (including by automated means) of personal data, as well as for their transfer to third parties, is 
        provided by marking consent in the relevant form on the website. <br>
        2.7. Personal data is processed in accordance with the Law of Ukraine “On Personal Data 
        Protection.” By completing forms on the web resource that include personal data, the user 
        voluntarily agrees to this Privacy Policy. If the user does not agree with the terms of this Privacy 
        Policy, they may not continue using the services of the web resource.
    </p>
    <h3>
        III. CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION
    </h3>
    <p>
        3.1. Confidential information includes: <br>
        3.1.1. Personal information provided by a patient when leaving comments on the web resource or 
        booking an appointment through the website, including: <br>
        ● phone number; <br>
        ● email address; <br>
        ● first and last name; <br>
        ● health status.
    </p>
    <h3>
        IV. INTERACTION WITH THIRD PARTIES
    </h3>
    <p>
        4.1. Profi Dental and its Branch recognize that personal data is an integral part of every individual’s 
        private life and make every effort to protect it. All information voluntarily and consciously provided 
        by users is processed with the highest level of confidentiality and in accordance with applicable 
        legal standards. Unauthorized disclosure of information constituting medical confidentiality may 
        result in liability under applicable law. <br>
        4.2. The web resource may contain links to third-party websites provided for informational 
        purposes only. When following such links, users should note that this Privacy Policy does not apply 
        to those websites. Profi Dental recommends reviewing the privacy policies of each external 
        resource before providing any information that may be used for identification. <br>
        4.3. Copied information must contain an active hyperlink to the web resource. Copying 
        information from the web resource is permitted for non-commercial purposes for placement on 
        visitors’ pages, blogs, or social networks. Use of the web resource does not grant visitors any 
        intellectual property rights to the website, its content, or any branding elements or logos.
    </p>
    <h3>
        V. PROCEDURE FOR STORAGE, USE, PROVISION, AND RECORDING OF CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION
    </h3>
    <p>
        5.1. Electronic media containing confidential information and electronic data storage systems 
        must be protected by appropriate security passwords. <br>
        5.2. When working with electronic media, employees are prohibited, without prior approval from 
        management, from: <br>
        5.2.1. copying electronic media containing confidential information, removing such copies from 
        the office, or transferring them to unauthorized persons; <br>
        5.2.2. disclosing confidential information to employees or third parties who do not have authorized 
        access. <br>
        5.3. Confidential information may be provided to counterparties upon entering into agreements 
        and at their request, subject to prior approval by the owners of the personal data. <br>
        5.4. Confidential information may be provided exclusively upon written request from 
        representatives of state authorities, supervisory bodies, or law enforcement agencies.
    </p>
    <h3>
        VI. FINAL PROVISIONS
    </h3>
    <p>
        6.1. Profi Dental reserves the right to unilaterally amend this Privacy Policy. <br>
        6.2. If you have any questions, please contact us at: clinic@profidental.com.ua <br>
        6.3. Location of the Profi Dental Medical Dental Center: 112-A Pyrohova Street, Vinnytsia, Ukraine. <br>
        6.4. Location of the Profi Dental Kyiv Branch: 206 Borshchahivska Street, Kyiv, Ukraine.
    </p>
</section>

